(7508551, 1197581, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge		<br/> <br/>Congratulations Gin Tay on your commendable score and placing. This is a lovely image that fulfils the challenge brief very well. The simplicity, the diagonals, the lighting they all make a major contribution to create a very effective pattern image that has impact.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge		 Congratulations Gin Tay on your commendable score and placing. This is a lovely image that fulfils the challenge brief very well. The simplicity, the diagonals, the lighting they all make a major contribution to create a very effective pattern image that has impact.', '2017-04-10 09:06:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7508552, 1197901, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes to the challenge		<br/> <br/>I can see why you were drawn to this subject for the challenge. There are some lovely repeating patterns in the boats, the rigging, the decking. Its just such a shame that those poles disrupt the full potential of your shot but obviously theres nothing you could do about them. Take a chainsaw with you next time!</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes to the challenge		 I can see why you were drawn to this subject for the challenge. There are some lovely repeating patterns in the boats, the rigging, the decking. Its just such a shame that those poles disrupt the full potential of your shot but obviously theres nothing you could do about them. Take a chainsaw with you next time!', '2017-04-10 09:11:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7508553, 1197878, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes to the challenge		<br/> <br/>Most appropriate choice of subject for the challenge Janine. Nice strong diagonals and repeating shapes in the reflections, a very effective composition and nice low key exposure. Given the nature of the subject with its plain surfaces perhaps a cloud-free sky may have improved it further</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes to the challenge		 Most appropriate choice of subject for the challenge Janine. Nice strong diagonals and repeating shapes in the reflections, a very effective composition and nice low key exposure. Given the nature of the subject with its plain surfaces perhaps a cloud-free sky may have improved it further', '2017-04-10 09:22:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7508554, 1197474, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes to the challenge		<br/> <br/>A great image Marcel, strength in its simplicity. The repeating patterns of the brickwork work well and the contrast of the wooden seat too, but the discarded newspaper really completes the scene giving it a powerful sense of life deserted. The bold colours work well too. This looks like the same day you took woman texting ? You are continuing to develop your creative vision well Marcel keep up the good progress.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes to the challenge		 A great image Marcel, strength in its simplicity. The repeating patterns of the brickwork work well and the contrast of the wooden seat too, but the discarded newspaper really completes the scene giving it a powerful sense of life deserted. The bold colours work well too. This looks like the same day you took woman texting ? You are continuing to develop your creative vision well Marcel keep up the good progress.', '2017-04-10 09:32:39.000000', NULL, 0),
